Final Instructor Note (Read This Twice) 
That feeling of: 
“Thereʼs always something else… another way… something deeper…” 
Thatʼs not failure. 
Thatʼs abstraction having no ceiling. 
The goal is not perfection. 
The goal is better judgment. 
